                                "sense_id": "809ade68-08d4-3285-99b1-ac5dc6662221",
                                "text": "Hitherto I have hoarded up mementoes and monuments of the past; been a worshiper of all heirlooms; a fond filer away of letters, locks of hair, bits of ribbon, flowers, and the thousand-and-one minutenesses which love and memory think they sanctify:—but it is forever over now!"
